WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.133 --> 00:00:03.036
- Bobby Darin singing
"Mack the Knife."

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:04.203
Let's have a nice hand for him.

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:06.306
(audience applauding)

00:00:06.306 --> 00:00:08.908
(lively music)

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:14.647
♪ Ooh, the shark, babe ♪

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:18.150
♪ Has such teeth, dear ♪

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:23.156
♪ And it shows
them pearly white ♪

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:28.995
♪ Just a jackknife has
old Macheath, babe ♪

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:35.301
♪ And he keeps it out of sight ♪

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:39.338
♪ You know when
that shark bites ♪

00:00:39.338 --> 00:00:42.308
♪ With his teeth, dear ♪

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:47.280
♪ Scarlet billows
start to spread ♪

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:52.786
♪ Well, fancy gloves, oh,
wears old Macheath, babe ♪

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:58.925
♪ So there's never,
never a trace of red ♪

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:02.695
♪ Now on the sidewalk, huh ♪

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:05.765
♪ Ah ooh, Sunday
morning, uh-huh ♪

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:10.770
♪ Lies a body just
oozin' life, eek ♪

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:16.242
♪ And someone's sneakin'
'round the corner ♪

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:22.649
♪ Could that someone
be Mack the Knife ♪

00:01:23.582 --> 00:01:26.318
♪ There's a tugboat ♪

00:01:26.318 --> 00:01:29.054
♪ Down by the river,
don't ya know ♪

00:01:29.054 --> 00:01:31.957
♪ Where a cement bag's ♪

00:01:31.957 --> 00:01:34.960
♪ Just a-droopin' on down ♪

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:38.331
♪ Oh, that cement is for ♪

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:41.301
♪ Just for the weight, dear ♪

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:46.272
♪ Five'll get ya ten, old
Macky's back in town ♪

00:01:47.506 --> 00:01:49.842
♪ Now did ya hear
about Louie Miller ♪

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:52.812
♪ He disappeared, babe ♪

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:57.783
♪ After drawin' out all
his hard-earned cash ♪

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:03.423
♪ And now Macheath spends
just like a sailor ♪

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:09.896
♪ Could it be our boy's
done somethin' rash, whoo ♪

00:02:11.096 --> 00:02:13.198
♪ Jenny Diver, yeah ♪

00:02:13.198 --> 00:02:16.235
♪ Whoa, Sukey Tawdry ♪

00:02:16.235 --> 00:02:19.205
♪ Look out Miss Lotte Lenya ♪

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:22.442
♪ Not to mention
old Lucy Brown ♪

00:02:22.442 --> 00:02:27.447
♪ Oh, that line forms
on the right, babe ♪

00:02:28.647 --> 00:02:32.718
♪ Now that Macky's
back in town ♪

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:33.719
♪ One more, one ♪

00:02:33.719 --> 00:02:37.423
♪ I said Jenny Diver ♪

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:39.825
♪ Sukey Tawdry ♪

00:02:39.825 --> 00:02:42.628
♪ Look out to old Lotte Lenya ♪

00:02:42.628 --> 00:02:45.865
♪ And Miss Lucy Brown ♪

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:50.870
♪ Yes, that line forms
on the right, babe ♪

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:56.943
♪ Now that Macky's ♪

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:02.649
♪ Back in town ♪

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:06.419
(audience cheering)

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:10.456
♪ Look out, old Macky's back ♪

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:13.192
Thank you.
(audience applauding)

00:03:13.192 --> 00:03:16.930
Thank you very much.
- [Ed] Good night, everybody.

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:20.233
Bobby, come back
here and take a bow.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:22.601
What do you think
of this guy, huh?

00:03:22.601 --> 00:03:24.938
(Ed laughs)

